9. Error Codes

MANIFOLD_ERR_01: Divergent potential
TOPO_ERR_02: Filtration failure
LATTICE_ERR_03: Entropy collapse
ODE_ERR_04: Convergence failure
CRYPTO_ERR_05: Encryption mismatch
LEDGER_ERR_06: Commit rejected

